From: RagnarokMac <noreply@ragnarokmac>
Subject: [PATCH] Add WASD / arrow-key movement

Ragnarok has no directional walk packet, only "walk to this cell", so held
keys are translated into a repeated destination a few cells ahead - the same
approach the on-screen joystick already uses. The vector is rotated by the
camera so "up" means up the screen, not up the map.

Adds src/Controls/KeyboardMove.js and initialises it alongside MapControl.
Guards against walking while typing in chat, ignores Cmd/Ctrl/Alt combinations
so shortcuts still work, supports diagonals, and clears held keys on window
blur so the character does not keep walking after a Cmd-Tab.
